From: NanaZip for macOS
Subject: [PATCH] Littlefs: return the value read by ReadUInt16

ReadUInt16 discarded the result of MoMileFixedIntegerReadLittleEndian16
and fell off the end of a non-void function. MSVC happens to leave the
value in the return register; with clang this is undefined behavior.

---
diff --git a/NanaZip.Codecs/NanaZip.Codecs.Archive.Littlefs.cpp b/NanaZip.Codecs/NanaZip.Codecs.Archive.Littlefs.cpp
index f8a49b0..514ac90 100644
--- a/NanaZip.Codecs/NanaZip.Codecs.Archive.Littlefs.cpp
+++ b/NanaZip.Codecs/NanaZip.Codecs.Archive.Littlefs.cpp
@@ -452,7 +452,7 @@ namespace NanaZip::Codecs::Archive
         std::uint16_t ReadUInt16(
             const void* BaseAddress)
         {
-            ::MoMileFixedIntegerReadLittleEndian16(BaseAddress);
+            return ::MoMileFixedIntegerReadLittleEndian16(BaseAddress);
         }
 
         std::uint32_t ReadUInt32(
